name issue_85_video_pause
describe 10 s outage (tunnel) at 10 s: no video for 10 s. libwebrtc counts a gap of 5 s or more as a pause, not a freeze, so the blackout shows in video.pause_*
duration 40s
seed 1
at 0s capacity=2Mbps delay=40ms queue=300ms
at 10s down
at 20s up
reverse at 0s delay=40ms
reverse at 10s down
reverse at 20s up
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms >= 9000
expect video.pause_count == 1
expect video.pause_total_ms >= 9000
